<title>FRANCE: France to hold food aid tenders on Oct 22 -ONIC.</title>
<headline>France to hold food aid tenders on Oct 22 -ONIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will hold tenders on October 22 to sell 10,000 tonnes of soft wheat and 5,840 tonnes of soft wheat flour as food aid, national grain authority ONIC said on Friday.</p>
<p>Shipment dates for both tenders are November 6-30, it said.</p>
<p>France plans to ship 6,000 tonnes of soft wheat to Ethiopia and a further 4,000 tonnes to Eritrea.</p>
<p>The 5,840 tonnes of flour are destined for Yemen.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
